Package: tosi
Title: R Client for the Hosted TosiData Service
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Juha", "Itkonen", , "juha@tosidata.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a remote-only client for the hosted TosiData service.
    Authenticated, blocking requests display incremental feedback and return
    complete shared R tables, result models, discovery values, versions, and
    help. No private platform package or local execution backend is required.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
